<section class="about-section">
    <h1>About <span>Me</span></h1>
    <p class="about-text">Since <span>2017</span>, I’ve built my career in the gaming industry, working my way up through QA to become a
        <span>Project Manager</span>. Along the way, I’ve partnered with developers and publishers to bring major titles across the finish line, ensuring smooth launches and high-quality experiences for players worldwide. One of the parts I’m most proud of is mentoring QA professionals, many of whom have since grown into leadership roles themselves.</p>
    <p class="about-text">In <span>2024</span>, I began studying <span>Software Engineering</span> to deepen my technical skills, bridge QA with development, and broaden my perspective on the IT world.</p>
    <p class="about-text">Outside of work, I’m a <span>hobbyist game developer</span> who enjoys exploring every corner of game creation — from coding and animation to art, music, and storytelling."</p>
